      "confidence": "high",
      "text": "`tabs.open` accepts an exact `browser_instance_id` returned by current capabilities and routes the command only to that online Extension connection. When more than one browser instance is online, omitting it fails before dispatch with `AMBIGUOUS_BROWSER` and a bounded value-free candidate list; connection recency is never execution authority. The resulting lease records the chosen browser instance, and every later tab command follows that exact lease route."
